<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="command">house</ansi> command

The <ansi fg="command">house</ansi> command shows your lodgings and who can
come into them, and lets you take access away.

Lodging houses let rooms in three cities, each to people the city's own
folk will vouch for:

  New Plymouth    Hobb Pennock, Pennock's Alley, west of the Back Court
  The Confluence  Aubric Sallow, Quill Court, west off Hall Lane
  Thornwall       Brannoc Tull, the Burrow Mouth, in the tunnels past
                  the smugglers' escape shaft

You may keep one home in each. Each is separate: its own rooms, deeds,
guests and storage, and its landlord's deeds work only in his house.

<ansi fg="yellow">Usage: </ansi>

  <ansi fg="command">house</ansi>                  Your lodging, its guests, and the
                         lodgings you may visit
  <ansi fg="command">house revoke [name]</ansi>    Take a guest's access away, from
                         every lodging of yours they may enter.
                         If they are inside, they are put out.
  <ansi fg="command">house leave [owner]</ansi>    Give up your own access to someone
                         else's lodging

<ansi fg="yellow">Letting a friend in:</ansi>

  Buy a <ansi fg="item">Guest Key</ansi> from your landlord
  (<ansi fg="command">buy key</ansi>) and give it to your friend. They type
  <ansi fg="command">use guest key</ansi> at that lodging house's door, once, and can come
  and go from then on, whether or not you are there. Guests can walk
  every room of your lodging and take anything left lying about, so
  only let in people you trust.

<ansi fg="yellow">Keeping things:</ansi>

  A <ansi fg="item">Container Deed</ansi> (<ansi fg="command">buy container</ansi>) places a
  container you name with one word: type <ansi fg="command">use container deed chest</ansi>
  in one of your rooms. Then <ansi fg="command">look in chest</ansi>, <ansi fg="command">put [item] in chest</ansi>
  and <ansi fg="command">get [item] from chest</ansi>. Guests can use it too. A
  <ansi fg="item">Strongbox Deed</ansi> (<ansi fg="command">buy strongbox</ansi>) places one that opens
  for you alone. A room takes up to six. What they hold, and anything
  left on your floors, is kept for good.

<ansi fg="magenta-bold">See also:</ansi> <ansi fg="command">help visit</ansi>, <ansi fg="command">help list</ansi>
